---
export const title = "Disclosure";
---

<div class="rvt-disclosure" data-rvt-disclosure="disclosure-1">
	<button
		class="rvt-disclosure__toggle"
		data-rvt-disclosure-toggle
		aria-expanded="false"
	>
		Take a look at the numbers
	</button>
	<div class="rvt-disclosure__content" data-rvt-disclosure-target hidden>
		<p>
			Tuition and fees vary at each Indiana University campus. As you look at
			total costs, keep in mind that financial aid, scholarships and awards, a
			part-time job, and student loans can all factor into what you will pay for
			your degree.
		</p>
	</div>
</div>
